{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"a566ebff7849832feb6347c7648f26815143dd2cc29dfc51bed9140db807376a","ja":"もうすぐ記念公演　～お祝いのライブ～","zh":"即将迎来纪念公演　～庆祝的演出～","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c5c5da1af3233a487e4d83590a1dcc8bd065d704fd1e8d0209809423bb363f05","ja":"昴さん、●●●●プロデューサーさんの許可、\nもらってきました！","zh":"昴先生，我已经拿到●●●●制作人的许可了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"784f945922aa58ecd8c7170c048cc5d01acec8f40e6d11beaf4b8493facf9355","ja":"サンキュー、百合子！\nじゃあ早速、やっちゃおうぜ！","zh":"谢谢你，百合子！\n那我们马上开始吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"165e4414d4a70f64c900c96401e914e0d8ab5be875301968b5b2a8981119a906","ja":"あら？　ふたりとも、こんなとこで何してるの？\n今日は、公演はなかったはずだけど。","zh":"咦？你们两个，怎么会在这种地方？\n今天应该没有公演才对。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ca61174c2af54383cfa963a4c644230d71c61a9b089bf68d0b0ed37e21538d8f","ja":"ほら、もうすぐ劇場の誕生日だろ？　劇場だって\nオレ達の仲間だからさ、お祝いしようと思ったんだ！","zh":"你看，剧场的生日马上就要到了吧？剧场也是我们的伙伴，所以我想为它庆祝！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"846970a5b58f65bc5c7b7faecc6b70e6024201bd5f7a08467c7958954e5f45e8","ja":"それで百合子に相談して、記念公演でやる新曲を\nこのステージでやって、劇場に見てもらおうって。","zh":"于是和百合子商量了一下，想在这个舞台上演出纪念公演的新歌，让剧场的大家看看。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2d051d6adf92f9b5ff15580f5719dc65c86b16559b79367bbedbd9bfb8f98671","ja":"当日はみんな、他のステージにお出かけしちゃうので、\nちょっと早めの誕生日のお祝いってことで。","zh":"因为当天大家都要去其他舞台，所以就当作是提前一点庆祝生日吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2bc7511c865eef20882f525120d57d9c965a5ffc8afefdbbfcf826385e95a65e","ja":"説明しちゃうと、ちょっと\n子どもっぽい感じがしちゃいますけど……。","zh":"一旦解释的话，总觉得会显得有点孩子气……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"614d3e3bd1eb7455cba9898848f27c0835777ac6d69e4bf64222f946ab1cbbb3","ja":"そうね、たしかに子どもっぽいかもしれないわ。\n……けど、悪くないと思うわよ♪","zh":"是啊，确实可能有点孩子气。\n……不过，我觉得也不错哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f432af18a4632ab05992d91abe9b4348aceee34dab9a41933757bf176f8a2165","ja":"でもせっかくなら、もっと人数が多い方が、\nお祝いらしくていいんじゃないかしら？","zh":"不过既然难得有这个机会，人数再多一些的话，会更有庆祝的感觉，不是更好吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"00a4a9b1a9f5b2cc5dd7fb7c35ba8083ea2673c5b11d489f7377344dba5e65fa","ja":"それはそうなんだけどさ、\n記念公演のレッスンでみんな忙しそうだったから……。","zh":"话是这么说没错，不过，\n因为大家好像都在忙着进行纪念公演的训练……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0f59826d6130806fafe00b3a25ad946f41642cdcbe69a4a7e41b761ed7762472","ja":"まったく、不器用なんだから……。\n仕方ないから、この伊織ちゃんも参加してあげるわ。","zh":"真是的，怎么这么笨手笨脚的……  \n没办法，那伊织也来参加吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_880.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"88f0735b0ad3647958daa24364dbad7fbbf11114b323c3f1fc59bf435a660022","ja":"それに、他にもあいてそうな人がいたら呼んできな\nさい。きっとみんな、喜んで参加してくれるはずよ♪","zh":"而且，要是还有其他看起来有空的人，就把他们也叫来吧。我想大家一定都会很乐意参加的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
